                <mxCell id="52" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read this&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;messages is the alert index: one row per notable event (error, warning, or the info tail after a crash).&lt;br&gt;(source, ref_id) points at one row in the matching source table. It is a polymorphic pointer, enforced by the app and not by a foreign key.&lt;br&gt;sysstat rows appear in messages only when a threshold is crossed.&lt;br&gt;ts is UTC text, YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS. Every ts column is indexed." vertex="1">
